# Every checkout gets the same bytes as the repository, whatever core.autocrlf says (Windows runners and installs turn it
# on), so tests and bundled templates read the same files on every platform. Windows line breaks in users' files are
# handled by the code and tested with literals, never by what git checks out.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
